{"pageid":4743,"title":"Santa Airdrop","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Santa Airdrop</span>","revid":20825,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><i>\"</i>🎅<i>Ho-ho-ho! I come with gifts for all!\"</i> </p><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 523px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f3/Santa_Airdrop.png/revision/latest?cb=20251207045153\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"A picture of Santa&#39;s Sleigh in the air.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f3/Santa_Airdrop.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/523?cb=20251207045153\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"523\" height=\"293\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Santa Airdrop.png\" data-image-key=\"Santa_Airdrop.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Santa_Airdrop.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">A picture of Santa's Sleigh in the air.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p><b>Santa Airdrop</b> is an exclusive Christmas event that happens at variable periods, behaving similar to <a href=\"/wiki/Meteor\" title=\"Meteor\">Meteor Crashes</a>. When the alert above appears, Santa's Sleigh spawns in the sky for a moment to fly, then drops a present straight down containing Christmas-exclusive items. These locations are not the same as known meteor crash locations. When searching for an airdrop, it's important to note that Rudolph's red nose is visible through walls, appearing as a red marker.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Drops\">Known Drops</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Gift_of_a_Ruler\" title=\"Gift of a Ruler\">Gift of a Ruler</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Gift_of_